<title>BANGLADESH: Bangladesh forex market closed for public holiday.</title>
<headline>Bangladesh forex market closed for public holiday.</headline>
<dateline>DHAKA 1997-05-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bangladesh's foreign exchange market was closed on Sunday for a public holiday marking the Shi'ite Moslem festival of Ashura.</p>
<p>The Bangladesh taka was quoted at 43.7500/7520 to the dollar at the close of Saturday's interbank trading. Friday is the weekend in Moslem Bangladesh.</p>
<p>-- Dhaka newsroom, +880-2-506363</p>
</text>
